      "writtenOn": "2020-01-24T15:22:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if that has been the design principle used in Soong. Many types in arch.go (Arch, OsType, etc) are struct. I followed the existing pattern. Colin might want to comment here.",
