        "id": 1039338
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-24T16:14:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It would be helpful to have some guidance on when to use struct, *struct and interface as I do find it a bit difficult to tell which one to use at times.",
      "parentUuid": "cde4237d_12004e00",
      "revId": "698d6c7e9b4d435f21000b37fa5a998b2a6a83ce",
