      "writtenOn": "2020-01-24T15:22:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Without that PDK check, existing test fails.\n\n--- FAIL: TestClasspath (2.11s)\n    --- FAIL: TestClasspath/pdk_default (0.10s)\n        --- FAIL: TestClasspath/pdk_default/Java_language_level_9 (0.03s)\n            sdk_test.go:308: bootclasspath expected \"-bootclasspath \\\"\\\"\" !\u003d got \"--system\u003dnone\"\n        --- FAIL: TestClasspath/pdk_default/REL_+_Java_language_level_9 (0.02s)\n            sdk_test.go:308: bootclasspath expected \"-bootclasspath \\\"\\\"\" !\u003d got \"--system\u003dnone\"\n    --- FAIL: TestClasspath/pdk_current (0.10s)\n        --- FAIL: TestClasspath/pdk_current/Java_language_level_9 (0.03s)\n            sdk_test.go:308: bootclasspath expected \"-bootclasspath \\\"\\\"\" !\u003d got \"--system\u003dnone\"\n        --- FAIL: TestClasspath/pdk_current/REL_+_Java_language_level_9 (0.02s)\n            sdk_test.go:308: bootclasspath expected \"-bootclasspath \\\"\\\"\" !\u003d got \"--system\u003dnone\"",
      "parentUuid": "b7bb06c2_56f48ec7",
      "revId": "698d6c7e9b4d435f21000b37fa5a998b2a6a83ce",
